      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Functional-equation sign is a prerequisite coordinate for central questions in self-dual families. It separates forced central zeros from genuine large, small, nonvanishing, or rank behavior, can be projected inside trace-formula averages, and must remain visible when standardized value laws are compared.",
